  "name": "Sharper Tarkov Better Life",
  "slug": "sharper-tarkov-better-life",
  "teaser": "A simple and lightweight ReShade preset that improves visibility and enhances the overall look of EFT by making the game sharper without over-sharpening it or making UI elements an eyesore to look at.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2938.png",
  "downloads": 15237,
  "favourites_count": 16,
  "description": "<h1>Hey! This is <strong>NOT A MOD</strong>. This is a ReShade preset, meaning this is compatible with all versions of SPT/EFT.</h1>\n<p>Drag and drop the contents of the <code>SharperTarkovBetterLife.7z</code> file into your root game folder so that <code>dxgi.dll</code> is in the same directory as <code>EscapeFromTarkov.exe</code>.</p>\n<p>If you wish to uninstall, delete the files that are added by this preset.</p>\n<p>You do not need any mods such as <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/813-amands-s-graphics\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Amand’s Graphics</a> to use this preset, However, it is highly recommended. I wouldn’t recommend using any other methods of sharpening such as any present in EFT’s settings and so on. This doesn’t reduce performance unless you are GPU bottlenecked.</p>\n<h3><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/crosire/reshade/tree/v6.5.1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ReShade 6.5.1.2008</a> is PREINSTALLED. Press HOME to open the overlay menu.</h3>\n",
